Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:25.50,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Your morning eyes\NI could stare like watching stars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:33.00,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}I could walk you by\NAnd I'll tell without a thought you'd be mine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:39.50,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Would you mind if I took your hand tonight?\NKnow you're all that I want this life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:47.00,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}I'll imagine we fell in love\NI'll nap under moonlight skies with you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:54.20,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}I think I'll picture us, you with the waves\NThe ocean's colors on your face
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:01:01.50,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}I'll leave my heart with your air\NSo let me fly with you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:14.50,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Will you be forever with me?\NCause you're so blue
